// BT-5190: a non-Integer class that answers `timesRepeat:` with its own
// method. An inlined writing loop on it would bypass it, so it raises
// `stateful_block_dispatch`; a read-only block reaches the method.

Value subclass: Bt5190CustomTimesRepeat

  timesRepeat: _block => #custom
